{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116397","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116397/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116397/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116397/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116397","id":3951523493,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ES08O","number":116397,"title":"Fix GPUParticles2D trails not aligning to velocity","user":{"login":"heyomidk","id":11528303,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTI4MzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11528303?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk","html_url":"https://github.com/heyomidk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-02-17T08:36:50Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T12:57:24Z","closed_at":"2026-02-21T11:48:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116397","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116397","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116397.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116397.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes godotengine/godot#89449\r\n\r\nHello! This is my first contribution to Godot, feedback is welcome. \r\n\r\n### Problem \r\nWhen GPUParticles2D trails are used with radial/orbit/directional velocities, the trails don't align to the direction of motion.  \r\n\r\nThis was caused by the engine forcibly applying `PARTICLES_TRANSFORM_ALIGN_Y_TO_VELOCITY` when trails were enabled, which overwrote the process shader's velocity alignment with an incomplete cached velocity.  As a result, the radial/orbit/directional velocity components were ignored when determining alignment.\r\n\r\n### Solution\r\nRemove the forced `PARTICLES_TRANSFORM_ALIGN_Y_TO_VELOCITY` in `GPUParticles2D::set_trail_enabled`.\r\nTrails now respect the process shaders `Align Y` particle flag, making the trail behavior consistent with GPUParticles3D.\r\n\r\n### Breaks compatibility\r\nProjects relying on automatic y-alignment for GPUParticles2D trails will need to enable the `Align Y` particle flag on their process shader when previously they didn't.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n- Verified that 2D trails can now align with particles when they have animated velocities, and that toggling the flag turns alignment on/off for trails.\r\n- Here's how the fix behaves in my minimal repro project https://github.com/heyomidk/godot-minrepo-89449:\r\n\r\n![fix-89449](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a8c3a61e-770c-4aed-9772-3174af4a8b4d)","closed_by":{"login":"heyomidk","id":11528303,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTI4MzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11528303?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk","html_url":"https://github.com/heyomidk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116397/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116397/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}